    "detailed_description": "Remember one of the most popular stories from the bible.<br />\r\nThe tower of babel is a unique tower - builder and role - playing game.<br />\r\nPick a leader, hire workers, manage the economy and donations of the building site as well as the lives of your workers.<br />\r\nRemember you have 7 days to complete the tower before language barrier becomes a major problem.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES<br />\r\n<br />\r\n.PICK A LEADER who is excellent in trade or relations with other nations or can increase worker productivity<br />\r\n<br />\r\n.BUILD A FLOURISHING ECONOMY with donations from generous individuals worldwide as well as trading excess food and building materials for money<br />\r\n<br />\r\n.KEEP THE WORKERS HAPPY by paying wages and feeding them or their productivity will continue to decline till they are barely working<br />\r\n<br />\r\n.NEGIOATE TRADE DEALS when you are not satisfied with an initial trade offer but do not get the buyer frustrated or he will abandon the deal",
